{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013WD2qT9MfHsKbWvH5J7XHo","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→---\n     2→artifact: spec\n     3→loop: 1\n     4→project: tank-sim\n     5→backend: claude(opus)\n     6→role: planner\n     7→created_at: 2026-03-15T02:50:33Z\n     8→---\n     9→\n    10→# Feature: Workspace Skeleton, Core Types, RNG, and Save/Load\n    11→\n    12→## Description\n    13→Bootstrap the Cargo workspace with all four crates (`tank_core`, `tank_data`, `tank_tui`, `tank_scenarios`), define the full domain type hierarchy (`TankState`, `TankGeometry`, `WaterState`, `PlayerAction`, `SimEvent`, `TankSnapshot`, etc.), implement the deterministic RNG wrapper using `ChaCha8Rng`, wire up JSON save/load with schema and app versioning, and establish the `SimulationEngine` trait with a minimal concrete implementation that can apply actions to a queue and step through empty ticks. This is Milestone 1 from the spec — the foundation every subsequent feature builds on.\n    14→\n    15→## Acceptance Criteria\n    16→- [ ] Cargo workspace compiles with four crates: `tank_core`, `tank_data`, `tank_tui`, `tank_scenarios`; `tank_core` has no TUI dependencies\n    17→- [ ] `TankGeometry` struct is defined with all fields (`length_cm`, `width_cm`, `height_cm`, `fill_height_cm`, `glass_thickness_mm`, `open_top`) and derives `water_volume_l`, `surface_area_cm2`, `footprint_area_cm2`, `wall_area_cm2`, `mean_depth_cm`, `surface_area_to_volume_ratio`, `wall_area_to_volume_ratio`\n    18→- [ ] `WaterState` stores all required dissolved pools as total amounts (`ammonia_total_mg_n_total`, `nitrite_mg_n_total`, `nitrate_mg_n_total`, `phosphate_mg_p_total`, `dissolved_oxygen_mg_total`, `dissolved_inorganic_carbon_mg_c_total`, `dissolved_organic_carbon_mg_c_total`, `dissolved_organic_nitrogen_mg_n_total`, `alkalinity_meq_total`, and all 7 ion totals: Ca, Mg, Na, K, HCO3, Cl, SO4)\n    19→- [ ] `TankSnapshot` derives all display values: `tan_mg_l`, `nh3_mg_l`, `nitrite_mg_l`, `nitrate_mg_l`, `phosphate_mg_l`, `do_mg_l`, `gh_d`, `kh_d`, `tds_mg_l`, `conductivity_us_cm`, `ph` using the exact formulas from the spec\n    20→- [ ] `PlayerAction` enum defined with all 12 variants and validation logic that returns typed `SimError` (percentages in `0.0..=1.0` or `0.0..=100.0` as specified, non-negative grams/counts)\n    21→- [ ] `SimEvent` struct with `day`, `hour`, `severity`, `kind`, `cause_codes`, `summary`; `EventKind` enum with all 13 required variants; `EventSeverity` enum (Info, Warning, Critical)\n    22→- [ ] `SimSeed(u64)` wraps `ChaCha8Rng`; the RNG is stored in `TankState`; no thread-local RNG is used anywhere in `tank_core`\n    23→- [ ] `SimulationEngine` trait implemented with `apply_action`, `step_hours`, `snapshot`, `full_state`; actions are queued and processed at the start of each hourly tick in insertion order\n    24→- [ ] `TankState` contains all top-level sub-states: geometry, environment (ambient temp, hour-of-day, day counter), hardware (light, heater, filter, aeration), water, substrate layers, filter state, plant guild states, algae state, microbe state, microfauna state, animal (shrimp) state, detritus state, event log, and RNG\n    25→- [ ] Save file is JSON containing: `schema_version`, `app_version`, full `TankState`, queued actions, and serialized RNG state\n    26→- [ ] `save_load_roundtrip` test: create a state with a non-default seed, serialize to JSON, deserialize, and assert the restored state is identical (field-by-field equality)\n    27→- [ ] `determinism_basic` test: two engines with the same seed stepping 24 hours produce identical snapshots\n    28→- [ ] `action_validation` test: invalid actions (negative grams, out-of-range percentages, etc.) return `Err(SimError)` with descriptive variants\n    29→- [ ] `action_queuing` test: multiple actions queued for the same tick are processed in insertion order\n    30→- [ ] Invariant checks run after every `step_hours` call: no negative mass pools, no negative populations, index values clamped to `0.0..=1.0`, temperature above `0.0 C`\n    31→- [ ] `tank_data` crate has TOML deserialization scaffolding with `serde` and `toml`; preset structs for source water, substrate, plant, and shrimp profiles are defined (loading actual preset files is included)\n    32→- [ ] All preset TOML files created: source water (`soft_acidic`, `moderate`, `hard_shrimp`, `ro_like`), substrate (`inert_sand`, `inert_gravel`, `active_planted`, `coarse_porous`), plants (`fast_stem`, `root_rosette`), shrimp (`neocaridina_davidi`), process parameters (one default pack), and scenarios (`nano_cycle`, `medium_planted`, `warm_room`)\n    33→- [ ] `open_top = false` stores a configurable lid factor (default `0.25`) that will reduce surface exchange rates when those systems are implemented\n    34→\n    35→## Files to Modify/Create\n    36→- `Cargo.toml` - Workspace root with members `crates/tank_core`, `crates/tank_data`, `crates/tank_tui`, `crates/tank_scenarios`\n    37→- `crates/tank_core/Cargo.toml` - Dependencies: `serde`, `serde_json`, `rand`, `rand_chacha`, `thiserror`\n    38→- `crates/tank_core/src/lib.rs` - Module re-exports\n    39→- `crates/tank_core/src/types/mod.rs` - Module declarations for all type modules\n    40→- `crates/tank_core/src/types/geometry.rs` - `TankGeometry` with derived calculations\n    41→- `crates/tank_core/src/types/water.rs` - `WaterState` with all dissolved pools\n    42→- `crates/tank_core/src/types/environment.rs` - `EnvironmentState` (ambient temp, time tracking)\n    43→- `crates/tank_core/src/types/hardware.rs` - `LightState`, `HeaterState`, `FilterHardware`, `AerationState`\n    44→- `crates/tank_core/src/types/substrate.rs` - `SubstrateLayerState`, `SubstrateKind`\n    45→- `crates/tank_core/src/types/biology.rs` - `PlantGuildState`, `AlgaeState`, `MicrobeState`, `MicrofaunaState`, `AnimalState` (shrimp), `DetritusState`\n    46→- `crates/tank_core/src/types/events.rs` - `SimEvent`, `EventKind`, `EventSeverity`, `EventCause`\n    47→- `crates/tank_core/src/types/snapshot.rs` - `TankSnapshot` with all derived display values and construction from `TankState`\n    48→- `crates/tank_core/src/types/actions.rs` - `PlayerAction` enum, validation, `SimError`\n    49→- `crates/tank_core/src/types/state.rs` - `TankState` aggregate, `SimMeta`\n    50→- `crates/tank_core/src/rng.rs` - `SimRng` wrapper around `ChaCha8Rng` with `SimSeed`\n    51→- `crates/tank_core/src/engine.rs` - `SimulationEngine` trait and concrete `Engine` struct with action queuing, tick stepping, snapshot generation\n    52→- `crates/tank_core/src/save.rs` - `SaveFile` struct, serialize/deserialize with schema version\n    53→- `crates/tank_core/src/invariants.rs` - Post-tick invariant checking\n    54→- `crates/tank_core/tests/save_load.rs` - Save/load roundtrip test\n    55→- `crates/tank_core/tests/determinism.rs` - Basic determinism test\n    56→- `crates/tank_core/tests/validation.rs` - Action validation tests\n    57→- `crates/tank_data/Cargo.toml` - Dependencies: `serde`, `toml`, `thiserror`\n    58→- `crates/tank_data/src/lib.rs` - Preset loading and validation scaffolding\n    59→- `crates/tank_data/src/presets.rs` - Preset structs for source water, substrate, plants, shrimp, process params, scenarios\n    60→- `crates/tank_data/data/source_water/soft_acidic.toml` - Soft acidic water preset\n    61→- `crates/tank_data/data/source_water/moderate.toml` - Moderate water preset\n    62→- `crates/tank_data/data/source_water/hard_shrimp.toml` - Hard shrimp water preset\n    63→- `crates/tank_data/data/source_water/ro_like.toml` - RO-like water preset\n    64→- `crates/tank_data/data/substrate/inert_sand.toml` - Inert sand preset\n    65→- `crates/tank_data/data/substrate/inert_gravel.toml` - Inert gravel preset\n    66→- `crates/tank_data/data/substrate/active_planted.toml` - Active planted substrate preset\n    67→- `crates/tank_data/data/substrate/coarse_porous.toml` - Coarse porous media preset\n    68→- `crates/tank_data/data/plants/fast_stem.toml` - Fast stem plant guild preset\n    69→- `crates/tank_data/data/plants/root_rosette.toml` - Root feeding rosette preset\n    70→- `crates/tank_data/data/shrimp/neocaridina_davidi.toml` - Neocaridina davidi preset\n    71→- `crates/tank_data/data/process/default.toml` - Default process parameters pack\n    72→- `crates/tank_data/data/scenarios/nano_cycle.toml` - Nano cycling scenario\n    73→- `crates/tank_data/data/scenarios/medium_planted.toml` - Medium planted scenario\n    74→- `crates/tank_data/data/scenarios/warm_room.toml` - Warm room scenario\n    75→- `crates/tank_tui/Cargo.toml` - Dependencies: `ratatui`, `crossterm`, `tank_core`\n    76→- `crates/tank_tui/src/lib.rs` - Placeholder module structure\n    77→- `crates/tank_scenarios/Cargo.toml` - Dependencies: `tank_core`, `tank_data`\n    78→- `crates/tank_scenarios/src/lib.rs` - Placeholder module structure\n    79→\n    80→## Dependencies\n    81→- Requires: none (this is the foundation)\n    82→- Blocks: all subsequent features (geometry/temperature, dissolved pools, nitrogen cycle, substrate/plants, shrimp, TUI)\n    83→\n    84→---\n    85→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_013aSVJ6RroqQ847pQy5QRmW","session_id":"8646385e-534a-4d68-9ebc-889753621e92","uuid":"d63c8805-cffb-4d00-996e-930aa215fe5b"}
